A '''hyperlane''' ran through the [[Mid Rim Territories]], branching off the [[Corellian Run]] at [[Druckenwell]] and heading east to [[Monastery]], [[Tah'Nuhna]], the [[Nexus Ortai system]], and ending at [[Bothawui]] in [[Bothan Space]]. It crossed [[Lannik–Leritor hyperlane|another hyperlane]] at Nexus Ortai, and met several other routes at the [[Bothawui system]]. A [[Kaaga Run|continuation]] of the route headed northeast from Bothawui before ending at [[Circumtore]].<ref name="Map" />

{{Route-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
In the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity, this route was known as the [[Reena Trade Route]], and was first mapped in the [[2009]] reference book ''[[The Essential Atlas]]''.<ref name="TEA">''[[The Essential Atlas]]''</ref>

